    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The Little Pixel That Could</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the pixelated shoes of <strong><i>The Little Pixel That Could</i>,</strong> a brave little pixel on a mission like no other. You must traverse a labyrinth of  hard drives, firewalls, and glitch-filled data streams to complete your ultimate goal: deleting the browser history of your  owner. As you dive deeper into this cybernetic odyssey, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of his life\u2014memories of joy, regret, and secrets best left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level brings unique puzzles,  platforming challenges, and a slowly unfolding story. Unlock new abilities as you decode the story, and piece together the true meaning behind this peculiar request.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you succeed in wiping away the past, or will the memories you uncover change your perspective forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Platforming Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/348fd41e322b77462d743d27c560dd00.poster.avif?t=1749286523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/348fd41e322b77462d743d27c560dd00.webm?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/348fd41e322b77462d743d27c560dd00.mp4?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Rich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/48740bf09a66cb336cc8eda62a4fb635.avif?t=1749286523\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/10599a1da8ea4446eff5c3350ec06120.poster.avif?t=1749286523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/10599a1da8ea4446eff5c3350ec06120.webm?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/10599a1da8ea4446eff5c3350ec06120.mp4?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Short...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a bittersweet journey of memory, identity, and redemption. <i>The Little Pixel That Could<strong>\u00a0</strong></i>is more than just a game\u2014it's a reflection on the things we leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join The Discord</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes a single-player game needs a player 2. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to share you insight, tactics, passion, or suggestions with other Pixels?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the Discord Link on the right  -&gt;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/ffc141170c5448d08e7318520404872b.avif?t=1749286523\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The Little Pixel That Could</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the pixelated shoes of <strong><i>The Little Pixel That Could</i>,</strong> a brave little pixel on a mission like no other. You must traverse a labyrinth of  hard drives, firewalls, and glitch-filled data streams to complete your ultimate goal: deleting the browser history of your  owner. As you dive deeper into this cybernetic odyssey, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of his life\u2014memories of joy, regret, and secrets best left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level brings unique puzzles,  platforming challenges, and a slowly unfolding story. Unlock new abilities as you decode the story, and piece together the true meaning behind this peculiar request.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you succeed in wiping away the past, or will the memories you uncover change your perspective forever?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Platforming Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/348fd41e322b77462d743d27c560dd00.poster.avif?t=1749286523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/348fd41e322b77462d743d27c560dd00.webm?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/348fd41e322b77462d743d27c560dd00.mp4?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Rich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/48740bf09a66cb336cc8eda62a4fb635.avif?t=1749286523\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/10599a1da8ea4446eff5c3350ec06120.poster.avif?t=1749286523\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/10599a1da8ea4446eff5c3350ec06120.webm?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/10599a1da8ea4446eff5c3350ec06120.mp4?t=1749286523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Short...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a bittersweet journey of memory, identity, and redemption. <i>The Little Pixel That Could<strong>\u00a0</strong></i>is more than just a game\u2014it's a reflection on the things we leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join The Discord</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes a single-player game needs a player 2. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to share you insight, tactics, passion, or suggestions with other Pixels?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the Discord Link on the right  -&gt;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419800/extras/ffc141170c5448d08e7318520404872b.avif?t=1749286523\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p>",
